      {
        "id": "home",
        "slug": "home",
        "status": "published",
        "data": {
          "title": "Smoky Cannabis Company | Premium Hemp Products NC",
          "description": "Shop compliant hemp-derived THCa products from Cherokee County, NC. Fast shipping on edibles, flower, and concentrates. Visit Smoky Mountain CBD for quality hemp products.",
          "brand_name": "Smoky Cannabis Company",
          "nav_label": "Shop Smoky Mountain CBD",
          "nav_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=nav_shop",
          "footer_text": "© 2026 SmokyCannabisCo.com — Redirecting shoppers to SmokyMountainCBD.com for ordering. We are not Great Smoky Cannabis Company (GSCC). All product availability is subject to applicable laws.",
          "og_image_alt": "Smoky Cannabis Company — not GSCC. Shop shippable hemp products at Smoky Mountain CBD.",
          "layout": [
            {
              "_type": "hero",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-hero",
              "eyebrow": "Cherokee County, NC · shippable hemp",
              "heading": "Smoky Cannabis Company",
              "lead": "We're not the Great Smoky Cannabis Company. We're Smoky Mountain CBD — a hemp-derived THCa vendor shipping fast from Cherokee County, NC. If you're looking to order edibles, flower, or concentrates online today, you're in the right place.",
              "primary_label": "Visit Smoky Mountain CBD",
              "primary_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=hero_visit",
              "secondary_label": "Shop edibles",
              "secondary_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/product-category/edibles/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=hero_edibles"
            },
            {
              "_type": "notice",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-notice",
              "heading": "Quick note: we are not GSCC",
              "body": "We're not the Great Smoky Cannabis Company, and we don't claim to represent them. We're Smoky Mountain CBD — a separate business using hemp rules to deliver compliant products to your doorstep."
            },
            {
              "_type": "text_section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-intro",
              "anchor": "intro",
              "heading": "A unique first in North Carolina",
              "body": "The Great Smoky Cannabis Company (GSCC) is the first and only recreational cannabis dispensary in North Carolina, operating on the Qualla Boundary in Cherokee under the sovereignty of the Eastern Band of Cherokee Indians. That distinction allows GSCC to serve walk-in customers on tribal land — even though recreational cannabis remains prohibited elsewhere in the state.\n\nWe want to be clear: we are not the Great Smoky Cannabis Company. We're Smoky Mountain CBD (SMCBD), and while our names and geography are similar, we serve a different need: compliant, shippable hemp-derived products you can order online today.",
              "link_label": "Explore Smoky Mountain CBD",
              "link_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=intro_explore"
            },
            {
              "_type": "text_section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-law",
              "anchor": "law",
              "heading": "Understanding cannabis laws in North Carolina",
              "body": "Recreational cannabis is not legalized statewide in North Carolina. Possession and retail sales of marijuana remain illegal outside of tribal jurisdiction. GSCC operates legally because tribal sovereignty allows the Eastern Band of Cherokee Indians to regulate commerce on their land, creating a narrow, location-specific exception for in-person purchases at their dispensary in Cherokee.\n\nFor everyone else — including residents who aren't able to visit Cherokee — hemp-derived products provide a compliant alternative. Under federal law, hemp and hemp-derived cannabinoids can be sold and shipped when products meet the delta-9 THC threshold. This framework enables online ordering and fast fulfillment for compliant hemp goods."
            },
            {
              "_type": "text_section",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-smcb",
              "anchor": "smcb",
              "heading": "Smoky Mountain CBD — local roots, nationwide reach",
              "body": "We're proudly based in Cherokee County, North Carolina — the same county where GSCC operates — and we specialize in high-quality, compliant hemp-derived products available to order online right now. If you searched for the Great Smoky Cannabis Company because of the name, the region, or curiosity about local options, we're here to give you a fast, reliable way to get what you're looking for.\n\nWhen convenience and compliance matter, delivery wins. Our hemp-derived products ship quickly from Cherokee County, NC, with packaging designed for protection and discretion. Orders are processed promptly, and customer support is responsive — because we know speed and clarity count.",
              "link_label": "Browse Smoky Mountain CBD",
              "link_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=smcb_browse"
            },
            {
              "_type": "category_grid",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-categories",
              "heading": "Shop by category",
              "intro": "New drops and core staples across edibles, flower, and concentrates — live category links on Smoky Mountain CBD.",
              "items": [
                {
                  "title": "Edibles",
                  "body": "Compliant hemp-derived edibles you can order online and have shipped.",
                  "link_label": "Shop edibles",
                  "link_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/product-category/edibles/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=shop_edibles"
                },
                {
                  "title": "THCa flower",
                  "body": "Fresh, aromatic hemp flower with THCa, curated by effect and terpene profile.",
                  "link_label": "Shop flower",
                  "link_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/product-category/thca-flower/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=shop_flower"
                },
                {
                  "title": "Concentrates",
                  "body": "Browse live cannabis concentrates on the Smoky Mountain CBD store.",
                  "link_label": "Shop concentrates",
                  "link_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/product-category/cannabis-concentrates/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=shop_concentrates"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "faq",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-faq",
              "heading": "If you were searching for GSCC",
              "items": [
                {
                  "question": "Are you Great Smoky Cannabis Company?",
                  "answer": "No. Great Smoky Cannabis Company (GSCC) is a tribal recreational dispensary on the Qualla Boundary in Cherokee. We are Smoky Mountain CBD — a separate business offering compliant hemp-derived products that ship."
                },
                {
                  "question": "Can I order GSCC products online from this site?",
                  "answer": "No. GSCC is an in-store experience on tribal land. If you need shippable hemp products, Smoky Mountain CBD fulfills online orders from Cherokee County, NC."
                },
                {
                  "question": "What can I buy online today?",
                  "answer": "Edibles, THCa flower, concentrates, and other compliant hemp-derived goods on smokymountaincbd.com, subject to applicable laws and product availability."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "cta",
              "_version": 1,
              "_key": "home-cta",
              "heading": "From Cherokee County, NC — get your order sooner.",
              "body": "Ready to shop shippable hemp products? Continue to Smoky Mountain CBD.",
              "link_label": "Start at Smoky Mountain CBD",
              "link_href": "https://www.smokymountaincbd.com/?utm_source=smokycannabisco&utm_medium=referral&utm_campaign=gscc_intercept&utm_content=footer_cta"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
